### The entries (VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client; run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger/JournalEntries?$expand=Items

### A balanced entry: 12,000.00 EUR bank debit against two revenue credits
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger/JournalEntries
Content-Type: application/json

< ./balanced-entry.json

### An unbalanced entry: rejected with HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger/JournalEntries
Content-Type: application/json

< ./unbalanced-entry.json

### An entry in a closed period: rejected with HTTP 400
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/ledger/JournalEntries
Content-Type: application/json

< ./closed-period-entry.json
